<div class="section_content content" id="7685850_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">If any section or sections of this chapter shall be declared unconstitutional or otherwise void and ineffective, the validity of the remainder of the provisions hereof and their application shall not be affected thereby.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
